#. type: Title-text
#: ../scene.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Titanium 2"
msgstr "Titanio 2"

#. type: Resume-text
#: ../scene.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use the bot's radar to look for the titanium ore and bring it to the "
"converter."
msgstr "Usa il radar per trovare il minerale e portarlo al convertitore."

#. type: ScriptName-text
#: ../scene.txt:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Titanium2"
msgstr "Titanium2"

#. type: \b; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Objective"
msgstr "Obiettivo"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Take a chunk of <a object|titanore>titanium ore</a> the exact location of "
"which we do not know. Use the bot's radar to find it. Bring the titanium ore"
" to the <a object|convert>converter</a>."
msgstr ""
"Trova con il radar un pezzo di <a object|titanore>minerale di titanio</a> di"
" cui non conosci la posizione e portalo al <a "
"object|convert>convertitore</a>."

#. type: \t; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Program"
msgstr "Programma"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:5
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"As you have certainly noticed, the programs written in the previous "
"exercises were completely \"blind\": if the titanium ore, the power cell or "
"the spiders had been at another location, the bot would not have found them."
msgstr ""
"I programmi precedenti erano «ciechi»: con minerale, batterie o ragni in "
"posizioni diverse, il robot non li avrebbe trovati."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The radar represents the \"eyes\" of the bot. With the radar, it can detect "
"the objects around it. For example the instruction <c/><a "
"cbot|radar>radar</a>(TitaniumOre);<n/> will return information about the "
"closest chunk of <a object|titanore>titanium ore</a>. However, we will have "
"to \"store\" the information returned by the instruction <c/><a "
"cbot|radar>radar</a>(TitaniumOre);<n/> somewhere. For this task we will need"
" a <a cbot|var>variable</a>."
msgstr ""
"Il radar è l’«occhio» del robot e rileva gli oggetti circostanti. Per "
"esempio <c/><a cbot|radar>radar</a>(TitaniumOre);<n/> descrive il <a "
"object|titanore>minerale</a> più vicino. Dobbiamo però conservare il "
"risultato di <c/><a cbot|radar>radar</a>(TitaniumOre);<n/> da qualche parte:"
" serve una <a cbot|var>variabile</a>."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:9
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A <a cbot|var>variable</a> is like a small box with a name where you can put"
" some information, retrieve it, change it, etc. Before you can use a "
"variable, you have got to declare it. First you must indicate the <a "
"cbot|type>type</a> of the variable, in this case <code>object</code>. A "
"variable of this type can contain all the information describing an object "
"such as a chunk of titanium ore, a spider, an ant, a bot, a power cell, etc."
" Then you must write the name that you want to give to the variable, for "
"example <code>item</code>. If we put this together, we get the following "
"line:"
msgstr ""
"Una <a cbot|var>variabile</a> è come una piccola scatola con un nome: puoi "
"inserirvi informazioni, leggerle e modificarle. Prima di usarla devi "
"dichiararla, indicando il <a cbot|type>tipo</a>. Qui useremo "
"<code>object</code>, che contiene i dati di un oggetto, come un pezzo di "
"minerale, un ragno, una formica, un robot o una batteria. Scegli poi il nome"
" della variabile, per esempio <code>item</code>. La dichiarazione completa "
"è:"

#. type: Source code
#: ../help/help.E.txt:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "<a cbot|type>object</a> item;"
msgstr "<a cbot|type>object</a> item;"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:13
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Then we must put the information returned by the instruction <code><a "
"cbot|radar>radar</a>(TitaniumOre)</code> into this variable:"
msgstr ""
"Memorizza poi il risultato di <code><a "
"cbot|radar>radar</a>(TitaniumOre)</code> nella variabile:"

#. type: Source code
#: ../help/help.E.txt:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "item = <a cbot|radar>radar</a>(TitaniumOre);"
msgstr "item = <a cbot|radar>radar</a>(TitaniumOre);"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:17
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The variable <code>item</code> contains many different kinds of information:"
" it contains the position, the orientation, the pitch, etc. In order to get "
"the position of the chunk of titanium ore, write <code>item.position</code>."
" Then we use the instruction <c/>goto();<n/> in order to move the bot to "
"this position. Here is a line that puts all this together:"
msgstr ""
"La variabile <code>item</code> contiene diversi dati sull’oggetto, fra cui "
"posizione, orientamento e inclinazione. Per ottenere la posizione del pezzo "
"di minerale di titanio, scrivi <code>item.position</code>. Puoi poi "
"raggiungerla con <c/>goto();<n/>. Questa riga combina le due operazioni:"

#. type: Source code
#: ../help/help.E.txt:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "<a cbot|goto>goto</a>(item.position);"
msgstr "<a cbot|goto>goto</a>(item.position);"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:21
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If we \"translate\" this into English, this would mean: go to the position "
"of the object described by the variable <code>item</code>."
msgstr ""
"In parole semplici: vai alla posizione dell’oggetto descritto da "
"<code>item</code>."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:23
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can then just pick up what is at this position with the instruction "
"<c/><a cbot|grab>grab</a>();<n/>."
msgstr "Prendi poi l’oggetto con <c/><a cbot|grab>grab</a>();<n/>."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "If we put all this together, we get the following program:"
msgstr "Mettendo insieme le istruzioni otteniamo:"

#. type: Source code
#: ../help/help.E.txt:27
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"extern void object::Titanium2( )\n"
"{\n"
"\t\n"
"\t<a cbot|type>object</a> item;\n"
"\titem = <a cbot|radar>radar</a>(TitaniumOre);\n"
"\t<a cbot|goto>goto</a>(item.position);\n"
"\tgrab();\n"
"\t\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"extern void object::Titanium2( )\n"
"{\n"
"\t\n"
"\t<a cbot|type>object</a> item;\n"
"\titem = <a cbot|radar>radar</a>(TitaniumOre);\n"
"\t<a cbot|goto>goto</a>(item.position);\n"
"\tgrab();\n"
"\t\n"
"}"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:37
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Then you must look for the <a cbot|convert>converter</a>, and put the "
"information about the converter into the variable <code>item</code>:"
msgstr ""
"Cerca quindi il <a object|convert>convertitore</a> e memorizzane i dati in "
"<code>item</code>:"

#. type: Source code
#: ../help/help.E.txt:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "item = <a cbot|radar>radar</a>(Converter);"
msgstr "item = <a cbot|radar>radar</a>(Converter);"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:41
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Go to the converter with the same instruction <c/><a "
"cbot|goto>goto</a>(item.position);<n/> as above, drop the titanium, and step"
" back. The converter will take care of the rest."
msgstr ""
"Raggiungilo con <c/><a cbot|goto>goto</a>(item.position);<n/>, posa il "
"minerale e arretra. Il convertitore farà il resto."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:43
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you want to know more about the \"names\" of the different objects in the"
" programming language, please refer to the <a cbot|category>text about "
"categories</a>."
msgstr ""
"Per conoscere i nomi degli oggetti nel linguaggio, consulta le <a "
"cbot|category>categorie</a>."

#. type: \t; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:45
#, no-wrap
msgid "Remarks"
msgstr "Osservazioni"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:46
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A <a cbot|var>variable</a> must be declared only once at the beginning of "
"the program! You can then use it as often as you want."
msgstr ""
"Dichiara una <a cbot|var>variabile</a> una sola volta all’inizio; poi "
"riutilizzala quanto vuoi."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:48
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In order to avoid retyping the instructions explained above, you can select "
"them with the mouse, and copy-paste <button 61/> them into your program."
msgstr ""
"Per non riscrivere le istruzioni, selezionale con il mouse e copiale <button"
" 61/> nel programma."

#. type: \t; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:50
#, no-wrap
msgid "See also"
msgstr "Vedi anche"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:51
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<a cbot>Programming</a>, <a cbot|type>types</a> and <a "
"cbot|category>categories</a>."
msgstr ""
"<a cbot>Programmazione</a>, <a cbot|type>tipi</a> e <a "
"cbot|category>categorie</a>."
